attributeTypes ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.56521.389.2.31.3.5 NAME 'monitorConnectionID' DESC 'Unique integer identifier for a connection' EQUALITY integerMatch SYNTAX 1.3.6.1.4.1.1466.115.121.1.27 SINGLE-VALUE NO-USER-MODIFICATION USAGE dSAOperation X-ORIGIN 'Jesse Coretta' X-DO-NOT-ADVERTISE 'TRUE' )
