attributeTypes ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.56521.389.2.31.3.10 NAME 'monitorConnectionBindDN' DESC 'The authenticated bind DN of a connection; if absent, bind is anonymous' EQUALITY distinguishedNameMatch SYNTAX 1.3.6.1.4.1.1466.115.121.1.12 SINGLE-VALUE NO-USER-MODIFICATION USAGE dSAOperation X-ORIGIN 'Jesse Coretta' X-DO-NOT-ADVERTISE 'TRUE' )
