attributeTypes ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.56521.389.2.31.3.19 NAME 'monitorConnectionResultCode' DESC 'The LDAP ResultCode returned following the most recent request sent by the connection' EQUALITY integerMatch SYNTAX 1.3.6.1.4.1.1466.115.121.1.27 SINGLE-VALUE NO-USER-MODIFICATION USAGE dSAOperation X-ORIGIN 'Jesse Coretta' X-DO-NOT-ADVERTISE 'TRUE' )
